WEBVTT

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:03.837
But that doesn't prevent them
from both being completely false.

00:02:03.861 --> 00:02:05.242
(Laughter)

00:02:05.266 --> 00:02:06.596
And they are.

00:02:07.333 --> 00:02:13.837
So let me start
with the second one: typical.

00:02:14.569 --> 00:02:17.151
Well, is this a typical place?

00:02:17.175 --> 00:02:20.140
Well, let's look around, you know,
look in a random direction,

00:02:20.164 --> 00:02:25.753
and we see a wall and chemical scum --

00:02:25.777 --> 00:02:27.163
(Laughter)

00:02:27.187 --> 00:02:31.828
and that's not typical
of the universe at all.